<item><title>Emi Koussi wins Chad&apos;s national oratory contest by 0.05 point</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/emi-koussi-wins-chad-s-national-oratory-contest-by-0-05-172285/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/emi-koussi-wins-chad-s-national-oratory-contest-by-0-05-172285/</guid><category>Chad</category><description>The university scored 16.85 out of 20 in the final, edging the National Higher School of Information and Communication Technologies.</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 08:06:33 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" length="30806" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Abuja Iyoto Galy builds a rap career in Chad</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/abuja-iyoto-galy-builds-a-rap-career-in-chad-b2bc00/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/abuja-iyoto-galy-builds-a-rap-career-in-chad-b2bc00/</guid><category>Chad</category><description>The artist blends rap, trap and afro-drill, using music for expression and denunciation in a scene she describes as largely male.</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 06:00:52 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" length="30806" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Wazouna Déby Foundation gives food and hygiene kits to 300 households</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/wazouna-deby-foundation-gives-food-and-hygiene-kits-to-300-36502e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/wazouna-deby-foundation-gives-food-and-hygiene-kits-to-300-36502e/</guid><category>Chad</category><description>The Chadian NGO distributed rice, oil, pasta, soap and mosquito nets in Machaga and Birbété to households identified with local leaders.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 19:57:36 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" length="30806" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Chad equips six health facilities in Mandoul province</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-equips-six-health-facilities-in-mandoul-province-efb5a7/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-equips-six-health-facilities-in-mandoul-province-efb5a7/</guid><category>Chad</category><description>The health ministry handed medical-technical equipment to two district hospitals and four health centres serving four districts of the province.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 18:37:06 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" length="30806" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Chad launches nationwide clean-up to fight dengue and malaria</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-launches-nationwide-clean-up-to-fight-dengue-and-4bac92/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-launches-nationwide-clean-up-to-fight-dengue-and-4bac92/</guid><category>Chad</category><description>Prime Minister Allah Maye Halina began the campaign at Dembé market, with work targeting mosquito breeding sites, rubbish dumps and public spaces.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 13:57:36 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-launches-nationwide-clean-up-to-fight-dengue-and-4bac92/share.jpg" length="41480" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-launches-nationwide-clean-up-to-fight-dengue-and-4bac92/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
